; GPUI native host build — same module set as apple/. The shared
; ../src + ../subs copies and the generated-table rules below are
; identical to apple/dune; the apple/*.ml files (the native platform
; twin: platform.ml, vdom.ml, logseq_dom.ml, bridge, …) are copied
; from ../apple so the two hosts can never drift. Only the library
; name differs; host selection is the host_code the Rust host passes
; to lui_ocaml_start (6 = GPUIHost).

